@HOST = localhost
@PORT = 1234

GET http://{{HOST}}:{{PORT}}/

# --- Rutas API --- 

### Obtener infomación de todos los poemas
GET http://{{HOST}}:{{PORT}}/poems

### Obtener infomación un poema por id
GET http://{{HOST}}:{{PORT}}/poems/cfd951ee-4bfe-40be-80dd-0ff5f69800a5

### Obtener infomación de poemas filtrados por writer
GET http://{{HOST}}:{{PORT}}/poems?writer=Antonio%20Machado

### Crear un poema
POST http://{{HOST}}:{{PORT}}/poems
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "poem": "caminante no hay camino",
    "writer": "Antonio Machado",
    "year_publication": 1912
}

### Actualizar un poema
PATCH http://{{HOST}}:{{PORT}}/poems/cfd951ee-4bfe-40be-80dd-0ff5f69800a5
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "year_publication": 1812
}

### Eliminar un poema
DELETE http://{{HOST}}:{{PORT}}/poems/cfd951ee-4bfe-40be-80dd-0ff5f69800a5